                <td class="nosideborderleft">
                    <strong>Description</strong>
                </td>
                <td>
                    Determines the torque needed to produce a desired angular rotation about an axis of rotation (resistance to rotation)
                </td>
                <td>Determines the centroid of an area </td>
                <td>
                    Determines the moment needed to produce a desired curvature about an axis(resistance to bending)
                </td>
                <td>Determines the torque needed to produce a desired twist a shaft or beam(resistance to torsion) </td>
                
            </tr>
